{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S12加入“让对方安心”，S13改写了“谁也没法答应永远”的原意，S14又加入“不后悔”，部分地方把推测和补充解释写成了确定事实。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用加亮的关键短句建立了清楚的阅读锚点，观众即使一边听音乐一边扫屏，也容易抓住每段发生了什么以及人物心理的转折。它把感受拆成更细的层次，并通过到时出现的方式与音乐推进对应起来，从亲近、失衡、孤单、重新放松到接受，情绪变化更具体，也更容易感到前后是同一段关系的连续发展。Y的左右分栏并不难读，叙事也比较完整，但右侧短词较多地停留在并列罗列，音乐细节、身体感受和人物心理之间的对应不如X清楚。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b81b556f-a559-4c86-9479-1a9cd5d2febc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T022554637948Z", "elapsed_seconds": 101.969, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:27:36.624995+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "93eb6f559c5b691067bfda007b94665dae5198df8bb48ec8bd1df250877b607a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31